  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#10877;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#10877;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
