  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;represents two concentric circles with centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;represents a circle with centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ccd1bdb1-5d7b-4c31-b670-cc9d3572bc35-image.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;represents the region between the concentric circles with centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> contains all points on minor arc&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;of&nbsp;the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;has infinite elements.</p>",
